# Contributing

Contributions are welcome.

## Environment setup

Fork and clone the repository, then run:

```bash
cd {{ repository_name }}
make setup
make build
make test
```

You need a C++ compiler, `clang-format`, and `uv`. Meson and Ninja are installed
through `uv` for local development.

## Development

Before committing:

1. Run `make format`.
1. Run `make check`.
1. Run `make test`.
1. Run `make docs-check` if you changed documentation.

Please review [AI Usage Policy](AI_POLICY.md) before submitting external
contributions that used AI assistance.
